{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261125/photo/bkn-20261125191000303-1125_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261125201419\"/><p>警員圍封涉事小巴調查。(陳嘉傑攝)</p><p>西貢發生嚴重車禍。今晚(25日)6時32分，大坳門路清水灣花園對開，一輛103M路線專線小巴突然溜前，年約60歲司機猝不及防遭撞倒，並被捲入車底受困，途人見狀報案。</p><p>救援人員接報趕至，立刻從車底救出司機，他的頭部受傷，陷入昏迷，即時被送往將軍澳醫院搶救。警員圍封現場，以便調查事故起因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T12:44:04.755564+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T11:10:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T12:37:15.937275+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T12:37:15.937275+00:00","content_hash":"2ed13e470e4d35d9aa5d39b35616ea80dbd5b4918e1181e9bac891149fe89c0d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}